WEBVTT

NOTE Draft cues for "A task waits for room, then runs". site-media times them to the recording.

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
config-from-git renders one config per service, four items at a time.

00:06.000 --> 00:14.000
The pool is full, so render[12] is Waiting for capacity. The note above the graph says why.

00:14.000 --> 00:24.000
Open the pool: 12 of 12 cpu reserved. A running item holds the room this one needs.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
An item finishes and frees its reservation. render[12] starts at once.

00:36.000 --> 00:45.000
Nothing was retried and nothing was lost: it waited for room, then ran.
